00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.570
It's embarrassing, but I'm one of those

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.320
people who reincarnated into another world.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.080
Because I was able to do just a 
little more than everyone else,

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.750
I always stood out...

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.290
Meaning, I never had a single friend.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.920
Oh! But my parents and little 
sister loved me very much.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:09.760
Then...

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.140
And there it is!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.010
The famous reincarnated-into-another-world
 Out-of-Control-Truck!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.900
Because that happened...

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:34.280
A god-type person said I could be 
reincarnated into another world.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.740
And, of course, it would be 
with all the expected bonuses.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:40.830
The bonus I asked for was...

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:46.750
In my next life, I want to make normal 
friends and live a normal life.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.210
So please, whatever abilities you give me...

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.460
I want them to be average for that world!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.760
After that, I was reincarnated 
into this world and a lot...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.470
a lot... really a lot happened 
in these twelve years.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.850
Regular happiness...

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.650
I wonder if I'll ever find it.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.240
I'm sure you will.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.160
<b>Day Before the Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.490
Okay!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.250
I have complete knowledge 
of the capital!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.460
Now I can start school without a care.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.290
I'm back, Lenny-chan!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.170
Huh?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.880
Don't stop me! I'm going 
to look for Lenny!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:37.470
This is the busiest time of day! 
What will we do without a chef?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.140
Aren't you worried about Lenny?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.640
She's just a little late coming 
back from shopping. That's all.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.520
She wasn't at the marketplace.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.900
Mile-sama, you know...

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.440
You say you want a normal life,

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.070
but you do tend to poke your 
nose into dangerous business.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.530
Is something wrong with that?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.410
Not at all.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.160
Still, can you think of anywhere other 
than the marketplace that she might be?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.290
Could we use search magic?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.710
It's possible, but if we expand 
the search to the whole capital,

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.880
it would exceed even your data 
processing capabilities, and...

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.170
Your head would go boom.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.590
Let's not do that!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.300
At times like these,

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.180
it makes sense to try looking in
places like this first, right?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.720
Hey, this one's a gem.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.720
If we take this one, 
the boss'll give us a huge bonus.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.310
<i>I didn't think I'd get caught 
the second I walked in.</i>

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.100
You might've been a little too obvious.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:30.980
Halt!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.060
Huh?

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.610
Don't you dare touch
her with your filthy hands!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.780
It's Miss Sir!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.990
And who d'you think you are?

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.320
I have no name to give villains like you!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:44.830
Oh! I've always wanted to say this! 
That famous manga line!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.910
Get her!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.500
What're you flitting around for?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.010
Is that all you've got?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.880
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.050
Die!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.310
Welcome.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.770
Playtime's over.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.140
Whoa! She's really in a tough spot!

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.190
Mile-sama...

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.560
Oh! Oops!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:13.980
I started just watching...

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.740
Just come quietl—

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:21.910
Huh?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.320
Are you all right?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.200
This is...

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.160
sleep magic?

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.700
Wait. Huh?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.410
You're that girl.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.500
Hello...

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.380
I see. You were investigating 
the case, too.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.130
Then, you are, too?

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.130
Yes.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.090
Causing those children and 
their families to suffer...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.260
As a knight, I can't let 
them get away with it.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.260
<i>She was having all that trouble earlier,
 and she's a female knight...</i>

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.680
<i>Maybe she's the super-honorable martyr type?</i>

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.350
<i>Why is my brain going there?</i>

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.650
Is something wrong?

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:53.270
Not at all!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.560
If that's the case, I'd like to help.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.730
All right.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.990
I can't use magic, so it 
would be very reassuring.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.950
I'm Mavis. I look forward 
to working with you.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.710
Um... I-I'm Mile.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.750
Well... shall we start with 
a little interrogation?

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.250
So this is their hideout, is it?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:23.760
<i>No matter what world you're in, 
the bad guys always hang out in a warehouse!</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.220
What're you doing here?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.140
<i>There are bad guys who look 
like they come from the</i>

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.980
<i>Century's End in this world, too!</i>

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.690
<i>Still... In the scene where they first 
appeared they were this big, and now...</i>

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.400
<i>Suddenly they're normal-sized!
 Just as you'd expect!</i>

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.740
What could a couple of kids want around here?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.780
I can't help but wonder if 
he ever cuts his tongue!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:51.040
I don't really get it, 
but they seem pretty suspicious.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.120
Who's suspicious, us or you?

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.410
Should we kill 'em?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.750
Let's do it!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.830
Hya-ha!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.170
A real "hya-ha" in person!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.800
Why do you seem so happy?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.970
The garbage has been sterilized.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.010
Er, no! I mean... Fire magic?

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.930
A-Are they dea—

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.850
I didn't kill them.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.100
I held back so that you wouldn't 
get caught up in it, after all.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.900
Though, I don't think there'd 
be any particular problem

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.070
if villains who kidnap children were to die.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.400
You're looking for the children, too?

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.570
Yes. I'm Reina.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.070
Also known as the Crimson Reina.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.780
She told us herself!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.200
Oh, you're...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.750
There's a door.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.420
That just makes it feel like there are 
people locked up in there, doesn't it?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.630
It seems the only guards 
were the idiots outside.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.470
Are you all in there?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.430
We're here to save you.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.930
Please, Miss! We're scared.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.930
Yes. Everyone is here.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.940
All right. I'm going to open 
the door now, so... huh?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.810
That's strange.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:58.980
What's wrong?

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.150
This door doesn't have a doorknob or keyhole.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.820
It must be a magic door.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.780
I'll use unlocking magic...

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.820
It's unlocked.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:08.360
Huh?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.280
You truly are amazing!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.280
<i>She did magic without a spell?</i>

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.000
You! Mile, wasn't it?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:15.500
Just now, did—

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.580
I'll open the door now.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.380
I'm scared...

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.260
Are you all right?

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.630
I wanna go home!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.300
You'll be home very soon.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.800
Thank you so much.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.140
Huh?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.520
You're the girl from the marketplace.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.810
Oh! We meet again!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.230
If you'd like, please call me Pauline.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.400
More importantly, why did they kidnap you?

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.440
You're obviously not a child.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:51.200
Actually, I happened to come across 
them when they were kidnapping children.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.410
I thought that since both the 
children and I were in danger...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:57.580
I'd offer to look after the children for them.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.790
I'm not sure why, but they accepted.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.210
They really are idiots.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.260
Still, your courage and 
quick-wittedness are truly impressive.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.380
Well, considering the family business,
 this is nothing...

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.930
Family business?

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.470
With that being done...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.220
Heal.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.390
You can use magic, too.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.860
Just simple healing magic.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.520
Well, thank you. You're a great help.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.190
Um, Pauline-san...

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.860
Is there a girl here called Lenny-chan?

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.820
No. We're the only ones here.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.080
Could she have been taken 
straight to the boss?

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.040
I-It couldn't be...

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.460
You just do what you're told,
 and don't make a fuss!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.590
Okay! I will!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.590
Here I come!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.670
Mom...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:53.180
Has Lenny-chan climbed the 
stairs of adulthood?

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.720
Lenny-chan!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.470
Mile...

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.810
Huh? What's wrong?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.220
Please, calm down.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.390
She might be being held somewhere else.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.400
Lenny-chan!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.400
Wait!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.400
Lenny-chan!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.400
Huh?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.610
My, my. I thought it seemed noisy.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.820
What adorable guests.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.280
So you're the leader behind the kidnappings?

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.740
And if I am?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:20.200
Where are you keeping Lenny-chan?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:24.670
Lenny? None of the children I 
invited here go by that name.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:25.880
Huh?

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.340
It's no use talking with villains!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.470
Rage, flames!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.180
Into a blazing sphere!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.550
Fire Ball!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.810
Fire Ball.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.480
Reina!

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.230
You have a long ways to go, little girl.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:54.700
What if you set off the explosive 
powder we have here in the warehouse?

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.910
To think I'd be defeated 
by an abridged spell...

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.870
If magic won't work, then...

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.960
Oh, dear... That was close.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.420
Wow. I'm scared.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.880
Stop toying with the child!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.760
All right, all right.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.010
Take this!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.430
Mavis-san!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.640
H-He's strong...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.860
Good potential, but still just children.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:31.780
When we're nearly A-rank, it's no 
wonder they're no match for us.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.360
Stop! There's no need to tell them that.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.570
B-rank Hunters...

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.580
I will allow no one to 
interfere with my ambitions!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.290
Kidnapping little girls... 
What are you planning?

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.330
My ambition...

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.630
My desire is for...

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.000
a harem of beautiful girls!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.090
Huh?

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.720
And, of course, I only want to admire them!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.590
I'd never do anything 
improper or unpardonable.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:02.010
To see beautiful girls locked 
together in an innocent embrace...

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:05.810
To have them dote on me and let 
me use their laps as pillows...

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.810
That would be enough for me!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.770
That's right!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:14.230
Untouched, unspoiled little 
girls just like you!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:17.660
Huh?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.450
Wait! You mean me?

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.500
Wait, seriously? Please, no!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.660
How lovely.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.460
Particularly that modest chest of yours.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.080
What?

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.250
The bosom is a mark of womanhood...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.510
Seeing a girl holding back 
tears for the lack of it...

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:40.090
Letting me comfort her like a mother would...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.310
It's so perfect, I could die!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:50.270
Just because I'm a little flat... So what?

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.440
She's trembling.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.730
Don't scare her too much, boss.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.650
M-Mile...

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.610
I'm not sure why, but she
seems to be trembling...

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:03.990
Huh?!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:05.950
This can't be real!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.960
This is... It can't be...

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:11.460
Magical power so strong 
it can be seen... Really?

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.170
Pardon the interruption. 
Allow me to explain!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.340
In this world, magic is...

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.260
when we nanomachines take the 
spellcaster's thought waves...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.640
what is commonly referred to as 
"magical power," and cause various phenomena.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:26.270
And Mile-sama's thought waves are,

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:28.890
compared to the spellcasters 
of this world,

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.100
roughly 6,800 times stronger!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.810
That is why she can use magic with no spell

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.400
and why her physical abilities 
are so impressive.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:40.610
But Mile-sama asked for her 
abilities to be average, so why?

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:46.660
There's a little trick here.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.830
Among all the creatures 
in this world, there is one

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.620
that is considered the strongest.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.420
The creature which stands above 
all others, the elder dragon!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.380
In other words, Mile-sama is an average

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.880
of the weakest creature and 
the strongest creature.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.970
She gained half the power 
of the elder dragon.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.100
You can figure out the rest yourself, right?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.680
I...

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.770
I am...

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:12.560
I am still growing!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.590
I'm so sorry...

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.880
I'm sorry!

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:44.930
Mile!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:48.310
Getting all upset because 
she called me flat!

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:52.390
I'm not some mage who arrived 
on the back of a dragon!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:56.690
You know, Mile-sama, I don't think 
you're cut out for a normal life, do you?

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:00.570
I told you! It's not like 
I wanted this power!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.650
Oh, honestly!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:06.160
Didn't I say to make my abilities average?

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.950
Do your best at school!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:13.830
Went on a side trip
and got home a little late

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.830
Come back and visit sometimes!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:20.340
After I left Brandel, I thought 
I was messing up less.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:24.590
More importantly, was it really all 
right to just leave them like that?

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.090
I don't know.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:29.470
But now that they've seen that power, 
I can't face them again.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.220
And I probably won't see them again, anyway.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.270
Did something just stand up?

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.270
Stand up? You mean like Clara?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.270
<b>Hunters' Prep School</b>

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.230
It really is small. I thought since 
it's run by the government, it'd be...

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.610
Well, on the other hand, tuition is free.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:43.900
That's true!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.660
Okay! I guess I'll go register 
at the student dorms.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.910
Is this the room?

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.580
I'm Mile!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.050
I'm looking forward to 
getting to know all of...

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:05.970
Huh?

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:13.020
Didn't I Say to Make My Abilities 
Average in the Next Life?!
